      <a class="card" href="#contact" data-c="Office"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Home office" loading="lazy"><div><p style="margin:0">Home Office<span>Office &nbsp;/&nbsp; Yerevan</span></p><svg class="ar"><use href="#ar"/></svg></div></a>
      <a class="card" href="#contact" data-c="Commercial"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Commercial space, café" loading="lazy"><div><p style="margin:0">Commercial Space<span>Cafe &nbsp;/&nbsp; Yerevan</span></p><svg class="ar"><use href="#ar"/></svg></div></a>
      <a class="card" href="#contact" data-c="Living Room"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Modern apartment with city view" loading="lazy"><div><p style="margin:0">Modern Apartment<span>Living Room &nbsp;/&nbsp; Yerevan</span></p><svg class="ar"><use href="#ar"/></svg></div></a>
      <div class="quote" id="about"><p>Each project is a unique story, shaped by your needs and our vision.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="how" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <p class="sub">Five steps, one clear deliverable at each. You always know what comes next.</p>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><small>Week 1</small><h3>Consultation</h3><p>We talk about how you use the space, your budget and your timeline.</p></li>
      <li><small>Weeks 2-3</small><h3>Concept</h3><p>Three moodboards and a layout, so you can choose a direction.</p></li>
      <li><small>Weeks 4-6</small><h3>Design</h3><p>Drawings, 3D views, materials and a line-by-line budget.</p></li>
      <li><small>Weeks 7-13</small><h3>Build</h3><p>We coordinate the trades and visit the site every week.</p></li>
      <li><small>Weeks 14-16</small><h3>Styling</h3><p>Furniture, lighting and finishing touches, then the handover.</p></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

